    \u043d\u0435 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0432 \u043d\u0430\u0443\u043a\u0435.
    \u0421\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u00ab\u041f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0446\u0438\u043f
    \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430\u00bb \u0432 \u043e\u043f\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0435, \u00ab\u0422\u0435\u043e\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0430
    \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430\u00bb, \u00ab\u0427\u0438\u0441\u043b\u0430 \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430\u00bb.
    \u0412 \u0422\u0443\u043b\u0443\u0437\u0435 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0434\u043e\u043c \u0441\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043b\u0441\u044f
    \u0434\u043e \u0441\u0438\u0445 \u043f\u043e\u0440 \u0438 \u044f\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f
    \u043c\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0435\u043c, \u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0444\u0430\u0441\u0430\u0434\u0435
    \u0432\u0438\u0441\u0438\u0442 \u0442\u0430\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043a\u0430: \u00ab\u0417\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044c
    \u0440\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b\u0441\u044f \u041f\u044c\u0435\u0440 \u0434\u0435 \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430,
    \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439, \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0447\u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0442\u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043c
    \u043f\u0430\u0440\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b
    \u0422\u0443\u043b\u0443\u0437\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c \u0433\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c\u00bb.
    \u0412 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043d
    \u041b\u0438\u0446\u0435\u0439 \u041f\u044c\u0435\u0440\u0430 \u0434\u0435 \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430
    \u2014 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0437 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0445
    \u0443\u0447\u0435\u0431\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439
    \u0424\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0446\u0438\u0438. \u0420\u0435\u0437\u044e\u043c\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0439
    \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0434\u043e\u043a\u0441: \u0424\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u043b
    \u0447\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043c, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439
    \u043d\u0435\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043b \u043f\u0443\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c,
    \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043c, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e
    \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0442\u0430\u043b, \u0438 \u043c\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043c,
    \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u0430\u043b\u0441\u044f
    \u0432 \u0433\u0438\u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0445, \u043d\u043e \u0435\u0433\u043e
    \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0438 (\u043a\u0430\u043a \u0441 \u0412\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0439
    \u0442\u0435\u043e\u0440\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0439) \u0434\u0432\u0438\u0433\u0430\u043b\u0438
    \u043d\u0430\u0443\u043a\u0443 \u0432\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0433\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u043e
    \u0441\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0435\u0435, \u0447\u0435\u043c \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0435
    \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0433.
    \u041e\u043d \u2014 \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0435\u0440
    \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0433\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c
    \u043d\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e
    \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441\u0430, \u0430 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0442
    \u043b\u0438\u0448\u044c \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u043a \u043f\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044e."
  interestingFactsEn: "Pierre de Ferma is a person wrapped around a genius of mysteries, mistakes, genius vision and human weakness, and his life is a paradox. Here are the most detailed, interesting and unexpected facts from his biography and scientific heritage, which show him not only as a genius but also as a living person. 1. \"The Great Silk\": why he didn't publish anything.The reason why Ferma didn't publish any mathematical work under his name (only a couple of articles on optics) was because he wasn't a professional scientist and he didn't need money or academic titles. Mathematics was a hobby and a form of intellectual leisure.He often sent letters to colleagues (Mersenne, Robertval, Pascal) in which he did not give solutions, but only final answers or the wording of the tasks, as if he were challenging: \"How little can you find proof?\" He enjoyed the fact that no one could solve his problems for years. The irony of fate: If his son Samuel had not published his letters and notes in 1679, mankind could have lost a whole layer of great discoveries for decades.In 1637, Ferma wrote a famous phrase in the fields of Diofant's book: \"I found this truly wonderful proof, but the fields of the book are too narrow for him.\" Mystification or error? Over 350 years of maths have broken their heads trying to find this evidence.In 1994, Wyles proved theorem using a mathematical machine (elliptic curves and modular forms) that did not exist in the 17th century. The conclusion of historians: Modern historians of science agreed that Ferma was wrong. He probably used his method of \"find descent\" to prove, but this method only works for the degree \\(n=4).So for 350 years, the world has been trying to find proof of what Ferm simply didn't have! This is the greatest \"joke\" in the history of mathematics. 3. Teleport of ideas: correspondence across the ocean in the 1640s, Ferm had an epistolar dispute with Renee Decartes about optics and analytical geometry. Decart was arrogant about Ferm, calling him \"lawyer\" (in a disparaging sense) and \"havatun.\"Descartes once sent the Farm the task of finding a relative curve, confident that it would fail, the Farm answered the question in a few lines. Descartes, pissed off, claimed that the Farm's decision was \"accident\" and \"a game of mind that had no meaning.\" Later, it was discovered that the Farm was absolutely right and Descartes was wrong to define the relationship. 4. Double life during the plague in 1652 struck Toulouse with a plague epidemic.The survival rate was extremely low, and Parliament (court) lost many employees, and the farm was infected and was at death, and its colleagues in Paris, including the mathematician Jean de Bockard, declared him dead and even published a math panegire after him, but the Ferma survived.He wrote a report that he was sick and that he was sitting at home and...He paid a fine with humor, stating in his diary that \"it was cheaper than spending an evening in a crowd.\" 6. Why did he know the ancient Greek? The Ferma didn't just know the Greek -- he was a class philologist; he was invited to advise the printing press in publishing the original texts of Archimedes and Diofant; that's why he read \"Arifmetics\" of Diofant in the original.English and Latin translations of the time were full of mistakes. If Ferma had used a bad translation, he might never have formulated his Great Theorem, because in bad translations the terms of the task were distorted. 7. \"The number of Ferma\" and the error in Ferma's simplicity suggested that all the numbers of the species \\(F_n = 2\\2\\n} + 1\\) were simple (uninterrupted).The farm was convinced that it worked for all \\(n\\) 100 years after his death, the Great Eler checked the next number \\(F_5 \\) and found it divided into 641. The farm was wrong. It was one of the rare cases where his intuition failed him in numbers, but the very existence of these numbers is now at the heart of the construction of the right polygons with a circulator and a ruler. 8.The death in the judge's chair, unlike most scientists who died in silence in the office, Ferma left his life right during his work. In January 1665, he was on a business trip to Castr, where the court session was held. He felt ill between the sessions (presumably a stroke). He fell directly into the councilman's robes. He was buried modestly, and only 14 years later the world knew who he had lost.The son of the publisher, Samuel Ferma, the eldest son, was also a lawyer. He was not very good at math. His father was almost forgotten in scientific circles (four years later) when Samuel decided to publish the compilation of various mathematical essays.If it were not for his son's ambition, the Great Theorem of Ferma could have gone to Leta forever. 10. The heritage in the language and the existence of the name Ferma was not only in science. There is a \"Pherma principle\" in optics, \"Theorem of Ferma\", \"Chishla Ferma.\" In Toulouse, his house is still a museum, and there is a sign on the facade: \"Here was born Pierre de Ferma, who, as an adviser to Parliament, made Toulouse famous with his genius.\"He was named after Pierre de Ferma, one of France's most prestigious educational institutions, and a striking paradox: the Ferma was an official who hated publicity, an author who didn't print anything, and a mathematician who was often wrong in hypotheses, but his mistakes (like the Great Theorem) moved science much more forward than his colleagues' correct decisions.He is the perfect example that genius does not require professional status, but requires only passion for knowledge."
